 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Intrastat Processing (BDT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item provides system generated Intrastat declarations.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Intrastat is a statistical system used to collect information from enterprises regarding trade between European Union (EU) member states. When the EU was created in 1993 and the initial EU member states became part of the single market, information about their trade with other EU member states could no longer be obtained from customs documents. Intrastat evolved as a replacement to collect information directly from enterprises about dispatches and arrivals of commodities among member states. Today, Intrastat is used for collecting statistics on the trade in goods (services are excluded) between the EU member states.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create information provider</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage commodity codes and Intrastat service codes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Collect Intrastat data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Review Intrastat data</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate tightly with sales and purchasing processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate Intrastat declaration forms</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>欧盟内部贸易统计处理 (BDT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目提供系统生成的 Intrastat 申报。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Intrastat 是一个统计系统，用于从企业收集有关欧盟 (EU) 成员国之间贸易的信息。1993 年创建欧盟，初始欧盟成员国成为单一市场的一部分时，无法再从海关凭证中获取有关其与其他欧盟成员国交易的信息。Intrastat 演变为替代，直接从企业收集有关在成员国之间分派和到达商品的信息。今天，Intrastat 用于收集欧盟成员国之间货物贸易（不包括服务）的统计。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建信息提供者</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理商品代码和欧盟内部贸易统计服务代码</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">收集 Intrastat 数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查 Intrastat 数据</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio85b826eb2670461e8657d8966cb01042__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">与销售和采购流程紧密集成</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">实现 Intrastat 申报单自动化</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
